---
description: Wording for UI text, check details, errors and docs
alwaysApply: true
---

# User-facing copy

- Short, plain, specific: say what is wrong and what to do ("not in hosts:
  local.a.de", "run install.sh"), not that "an error occurred".
- Sentence case for labels and buttons. Buttons are verbs ("Add to hosts").
- Name real things: paths, commands, domains, in `code` style in docs.
- No em dashes. No exclamation marks. No emoji.
